KMC C++ API
===========

These files are the KMC database API, copied without modification from the
KMC project:

  Upstream : https://github.com/refresh-bio/KMC
  Release  : v3.2.4 (2024-02-09)
  Commit   : d6c24dc88010508336d824bbffbf1ef3f49fddf8
  Directory: kmc_api/
  Authors  : Sebastian Deorowicz, Agnieszka Debudaj-Grabysz, Marek Kokot
  Licence  : GNU GPL 3

Only src/kmc_to_pack.cpp uses these files. Because it links them, the
kmc_to_pack binary is distributed under the GNU GPL 3. No other program in this
pipeline links KMC.

The API reads KMC databases in the KMC1 format (version 0) and the KMC2 format
(version 0x200). KMC 2 and KMC 3 write the KMC2 format by default.

To update, replace the files in this directory with the kmc_api/ files of a new
KMC release, then update the release and commit above and run
tools/test_kmc_to_pack.sh.
